="35.663" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.501" end="29.139">Та</span><span begin="29.139" end="29.439">ют</span> <span begin="29.439" end="30.061">слов</span><span begin="30.061" end="30.256">но</span> <span begin="30.256" end="30.991">сно</span><span begin="30.991" end="31.337">ви</span><span begin="31.337" end="31.959">де</span><span begin="31.959" end="32.199">нье,</span> <span begin="32.303" end="32.873">слов</span><span begin="32.873" end="33.173">но</span> <span begin="33.173" end="33.827">у</span><span begin="33.827" end="34.133">трен</span><span begin="34.133" end="34.763">ний</span> <span begin="34.763" end="35.109">ту</span><span begin="35.109" end="35.663">ман</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是像梦与晨雾一般转瞬即逝</span></p><p begin="36.091" end="44.183" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.091" end="36.699">Пусть</span> <span begin="36.699" end="36.977">судь</span><span begin="36.977" end="37.599">ба</span> <span begin="37.599" end="37.951">тем</span><span begin="37.951" end="38.581">на,</span> <span begin="38.581" end="38.911">а</span> <span begin="38.911" end="39.557">рок</span> <span begin="39.557" end="39.863">су</span><span begin="39.863" end="40.312">ров,</span> <span begin="40.479" end="40.817">е</span><span begin="40.817" end="41.281">щё</span> <span begin="41.281" end="41.425">го</span><span begin="41.425" end="42.399">рит</span> <span begin="42.399" end="42.699">же</span><span begin="42.699" end="42.969">ла</span><span begin="42.969" end="43.230">ни</span><span begin="43.230" end="43.508">е в</span> <span begin="43.508" end="44.183">нас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵然前途晦暗，宿命严酷冷冽，但我们的内心却仍燃烧着渴望</span></p><p begin="44.611" end="50.925" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.611" end="45.197">Мы</span> <span begin="45.197" end="45.519">у</span><span begin="45.519" end="45.797">слы</span><span begin="45.797" end="46.141">ша</span><span begin="46.141" end="46.471">ли</span> <span begin="46.471" end="46.973">зов</span> <span begin="47.153" end="47.483">род</span><span begin="47.483" end="47.753">ных</span> <span begin="47.753" end="48.053">ма</span><span begin="48.053" end="48.397">те</span><span begin="48.397" end="49.313">рей,</span> <span begin="49.313" end="50.003">ро</span><span begin="50.003" end="50.333">дины</span> <span begin="50.333" end="50.925">глас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在命运残暴的压迫下，我们怀着焦急的希望，倾听祖国与母亲的呼唤</span></p><p begin="51.321" end="57.561" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.321" end="52.197">И</span> <span begin="52.197" end="52.505">ро</span><span begin="52.505" end="52.805">ди</span><span begin="52.805" end="53.143">на</span> <span begin="53.143" end="53.757">ждёт,</span> <span begin="53.757" end="54.095">что</span> <span begin="54.095" end="54.395">мы</span> <span begin="54.395" end="54.703">по</span><span begin="54.703" end="55.033">свя</span><span begin="55.033" end="55.415">тим</span> <span begin="55.677" end="55.985">ей</span> <span begin="55.985" end="56.637">юн</span><span begin="56.637" end="56.931">ые</span> <span begin="56.931" end="57.201">жиз</span><span begin="57.201" end="57.561">ни</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的朋友，让我们把心中美好的激情，呈现给我们的家园</span></p><p begin="57.925" end="1:06.004" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.925" end="58.509">Там,</span> <span begin="58.509" end="58.809">где</span> <span begin="58.809" end="59.215">мир</span> <span begin="59.785" end="1:00.415">пал</span> <span begin="1:00.415" end="1:00.699">во</span> <span begin="1:00.699" end="1:01.217">прах,</span> <span begin="1:01.710" end="1:02.302">там</span> <span begin="1:02.302" end="1:02.602">на</span> <span begin="1:02.602" end="1:03.210">кам</span><span begin="1:03.210" end="1:03.548">не</span> <span begin="1:03.548" end="1:04.154">впи</span><span begin="1:04.154" end="1:04.462">шут</span> <span begin="1:04.462" end="1:05.052">нас</span> <span begin="1:05.0